<view class="page"><view class="notice">仅收集比赛必要信息，不会创建南联学员档案，也不会自动进入招生CRM。</view><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">姓名</text><input class="input" value="{{name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">出生年份</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{birthYear}}" data-key="birthYear" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">球衣号码</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{jerseyNumber}}" data-key="jerseyNumber" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">备注</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{remark}}" data-key="remark" bindinput="field"/></view></view><button class="btn-primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存并继续录入</button><button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="done">完成</button></view>
